# Background tab of the character editor, in the Traits tab's style
background-tab-section-filled = { $filled } / { $total } filled
background-tab-physical = Physical description
background-tab-personality = Personality
background-tab-exploitable = Exploitable information
background-tab-secrets = Secrets
background-tab-personal-notes = Personal notes
background-tab-ooc-notes = OOC notes
background-tab-records-hint = NanoTrasen's file on the character. Each entry shows up read-only in its console's history at the start of the shift.
background-tab-records-count = { $count } { $count ->
    [one] entry
   *[other] entries
}
background-tab-warning = A character's background and station console records are never grounds for breaking the rules, nor an excuse for powergaming, kleptomania, self-antagonism or metagaming. Abusing them counts against you when dealing with the administration.
